<p>To check if these intervals overlap, we=E2=80=99ll need to identify whic=
h interval between <code>intervals1[i]</code> and <code>intervals2[j]</code=
> starts first, so we can assign that interval as interval A and the other =
as interval B. The code snippet for this is provided below:</p>
<pre><code class=3D"hljs language-python"><span class=3D"hljs-comment"># Se=
