<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">if</span> intervals1[i].start &lt;=3D interval=
s2[j].start:
    A, B =3D intervals1[i], intervals2[j]
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">else</span>:
    A, B =3D intervals2[j], intervals1[i]
</code></pre>
<p>In this example, <code>intervals1[i]</code> starts first:</p>
